{
  "about": "Golden vectors for the transcript eval's copies of 14-transcript-editing A6 (pauses) and 15-captions C1 (caption groups and rows). Each expected value was printed by the app's own code: web/studio/src/studio/transcript/editor/cleanup.ts candidates() and apps/desktop/src/captions/layout.rs track(), byte-identical copies of the files with these SHA-256 sums, English, one whole segment at speed 1. A pause is [lo, hi], the words' gap; its cut keeps 150 ms each side. A caption is its rows of words.",
